    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A quiet chapter... yeah. That's almost what it feels like. Like the noise has just stopped. There's no more battle cries, no more people calling my name, no more duty. Just this heavy stillness. I look at the sword resting against the stone next to me, and for the first time, it doesn't look like a weapon for fighting. It just looks... peaceful. Like it's the only thing in this whole broken world that isn't asking anything from me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
